    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check This Out!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096520/extras/b7148d4f7ebef931229e5f092a70df6e.poster.avif?t=1672939424\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096520/extras/b7148d4f7ebef931229e5f092a70df6e.webm?t=1672939424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096520/extras/b7148d4f7ebef931229e5f092a70df6e.mp4?t=1672939424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sail the oceans of Miloria and meet various characters across diverse climates.<br></li><li>Make political decisions on how to run your ship, balance your crew morale and profits.<br></li><li>Manage a seabound brothel to generate extra income. You can choose, dress and train the courtesans.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096520/extras/225b2a389befaf52397fc713e93291ae.avif?t=1672939424\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique dungeon system, where stat checks and player choices determine your success.<br></li><li>Card-based combat. Build a deck and improve it throughout the game by discovering new actions.<br></li><li>Collect Rarity-tiered equipment to improve your characters abilities during scenes and combat.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096520/extras/5e278e06b15d380b0cca938a81d4764c.avif?t=1672939424\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dating system, complete with relationship drama and regretful decisions!<br></li><li>Experience (fully optional) animated sexual content, with alternate versions and branching content.<br></li><li>(There are 25+ animated sexual CGs currently in the game)<br></li><li>Horny gals, beefy guys, insatiable demons, twinks, monster-girls, intersex, traps, and loads more kinky content types.<br></li><li>Optional Censors so that you may enjoy the adventure without any 'nipple slips'.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096520/extras/6afd74757581c87c42d8ed69acd14c0e.avif?t=1672939424\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dynamic NPC generation using a powerful character creator system.<br></li><li>Create your own character, and transform their appearance throughout the game.<br></li><li>Hire and manage randomized fighters and brothel workers. Level up and improve them.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096520/extras/535b26f36b5b12ff3ebc9d6d99d0f7ab.avif?t=1672939424\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Extensive modding capabilities. Share your own scenes, characters and kinks!<br></li><li>Beautiful soundtrack and stunning artwork by various popular internet artists.<br></li><li>An expanding development, with an open dialogue to the community.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1096520/extras/d0a9981e8f64167a986928c4f032dc52.avif?t=1672939424\" /></div><br><br>Venture Seas is currently a solo development (VentureSwitch) with occasional artwork commissions to ease the workload.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Venture Seas is a fictional story based in a fantasy world, where the politics, theology or prejudices of real-life do not apply.</h2><br>As a means to create an engaging story, characters may express opinions or actions that could be considered offensive or distasteful.<br><br>If you are skilled and interested in paid work to help speed up the development, please don't hesitate to get in touch!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">If interested, please add Venture Seas to your Steam Wishlist!</h2>",
